<title>USA: Wilmington Trust silver stocks edge up in week.</title>
<headline>Wilmington Trust silver stocks edge up in week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wilmington Trust deliverable silver stocks rose 3,009 ounces to 58,268,912 ounces in the week ended December 3, the COMEX division of the New York Mercantile Exchange (NYMEX) said Tuesday.</p>
<p>Wilmington Trust in Delaware becomes an official exchange silver depositary from January 1, 1997.</p>
<p>NYMEX will report Wilmington Trust data weekly until January 2, 1997 when Wilmington's eligible and registered silver stocks will be reported in the exchange's daily metal warehouse data.</p>
<p>COMEX silver warehouse stocks, excluding Wilmington Trust silver stocks, rose 135,055 ounces Wednesday to 148,455,705 ounces.</p>
